<% content_for :title, "HomeTab — Split home costs without the math" %>
<% content_for :head do %>
  <meta name="description" content="HomeTab keeps a running tab of rent, bills and every dinner run, then tells each person exactly what to send. For couples and roommates, 2 to 5 people.">
  <meta property="og:title" content="HomeTab — Stop texting “you owe me.”">
  <meta property="og:description" content="A running tab for rent, bills and groceries. One number, already netted. Pay in the app you already use.">
<% end %>
<% content_for :styles do %>
<style>
  .container { max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px; }
  header.nav { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; min-height: 72px; }
  .logo { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 19px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; text-decoration: none; color: var(--ink); }
  .logo small { font-weight: 600; font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); }
  nav.links { display: flex; gap: 22px; align-items: center; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; }
  nav.links a { color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; }
  nav.links .cta { background: var(--brand); color: #fff; padding: 10px 16px; border-radius: 999px; }
  @media (max-width: 720px) { nav.links a:not(.cta) { display: none; } }
  .hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr; gap: 48px; align-items: center; padding: 48px 0 72px; }
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding-top: 24px; } }
  .eyebrow { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--brand); letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(42px, 7vw, 72px); line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -0.035em; margin: 14px 0 18px; font-weight: 800; }
  .lede { font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--muted); max-width: 520px; margin: 0 0 26px; }
  .stores { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .store { min-height: 52px; padding: 0 20px; border-radius: 14px; background: var(--ink); color: #fff; font-weight: 800; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; text-decoration: none; }
  .store.alt { background: #fff; color: var(--ink); border: 1px solid var(--chip-border); }
  .free { margin-top: 14px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; }
  .phone { justify-self: center; width: min(340px, 100%); background: var(--ground); border: 10px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 44px; padding: 22px 18px; box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(21,32,26,0.18); }
  .phone .card { background: var(--ink); color: #fff; border-radius: 22px; padding: 22px; text-align: center; }
  .phone .card .money { font-size: 42px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.03em; display: block; margin: 4px 0 12px; }
  .phone .card span { color: #B9C7BF; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; }
  .phone .req { background: #fff; color: var(--ink); border-radius: 13px; padding: 12px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 14px; }
  .phone .row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 10px 2px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline); font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; }
  .pos { color: var(--brand); } .neg { color: var(--you-owe); }
  .toast { margin-top: 14px; background: var(--brand-tint); color: var(--brand); border-radius: 12px; padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; text-align: center; }
  section.block { padding: 72px 0; }
  section.block h2 { font-size: clamp(30px, 4.5vw, 44px); letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.1; margin: 10px 0 28px; font-weight: 800; }
  .steps { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 18px; }
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .step { background: #fff; border-radius: 22px; padding: 26px; }
  .step b.num { font-family: var(--mono); color: var(--brand); font-size: 15px; }
  .step h3 { margin: 10px 0 8px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; }
  .step p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.55; }
  .split { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 48px; align-items: center; }
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .split { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .feat { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; margin-top: 22px; }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .feat { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .feat div { background: #fff; border-radius: 18px; padding: 18px; } .feat b { display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; } .feat span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; }
  .ticket { background: var(--brand); border-radius: 28px; padding: 28px; color: #fff; }
  .ticket .paper { background: #fff; color: var(--ink); border-radius: 18px; padding: 22px; }
  .ticket .paper .big { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 44px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 6px 0 12px; }
  .ticket .line { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 6px 0; font-size: 14px; } .ticket .pay { margin-top: 14px; background: #fff; color: var(--ink); border-radius: 14px; padding: 14px; text-align: center; font-weight: 800; }
  .pricing { background: var(--ink); color: #fff; border-radius: 32px; padding: 48px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 32px; }
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .pricing { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 32px 24px; } }
  .pricing p { color: #B9C7BF; line-height: 1.55; } .pricing ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; gap: 12px; font-weight: 700; }
  .pricing li::before { content: ""; display: inline-block; width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #7FD3A8; margin-right: 10px; }
  .faq details { background: #fff; border-radius: 16px; padding: 18px 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .faq summary { font-weight: 800; cursor: pointer; } .faq p { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.55; margin: 10px 0 0; }
  .family { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; }
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .family { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .family div { background: #fff; border-radius: 20px; padding: 22px; } .family b { font-size: 18px; } .family p { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.5; margin: 8px 0 0; }
  footer { padding: 40px 0 56px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; }
</style>
<% end %>
<div class="container">
  <header class="nav">
    <a class="logo" href="/"><%= render "public/mark", size: 34 %><span>HomeTab <small>by Glofly</small></span></a>
    <nav class="links" aria-label="Main"><a href="#how">How it works</a><a href="#features">Features</a><a href="#pricing">Pricing</a><a class="cta" href="#get">Get the app</a></nav>
  </header>

  <section class="hero" id="get">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">For couples and roommates · 2 to 5 people</div>
      <h1>Stop texting<br>“you owe me.”</h1>
      <p class="lede">HomeTab keeps a running tab of rent, bills and every dinner run, then tells each person exactly what to send. No spreadsheets. No calculator screenshots.</p>
      <div class="stores">
        <a class="store" href="<%= ENV.fetch('APP_STORE_URL', '#get') %>">Get it on iPhone</a>
        <a class="store alt" href="<%= ENV.fetch('PLAY_STORE_URL', '#get') %>">Get it on Android</a>
      </div>
      <div class="free">Free. No daily limits. No ads.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="phone" aria-hidden="true">
      <div style="font-weight:800;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 12px 4px">You &amp; Alex</div>
      <div class="card"><span>Alex owes you</span><b class="money">$864.60</b><div class="req">Request $864.60</div></div>
      <div style="margin-top:12px">
        <div class="row"><span>Rent</span><span class="money pos">+$900.00</span></div>
        <div class="row"><span>Dinner</span><span class="money neg">−$25.60</span></div>
        <div class="row"><span>Groceries</span><span class="money pos">+$13.75</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="toast">Alex paid $864.60. You're even.</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block" id="how">
    <div class="eyebrow">How it works</div>
    <h2>Log it in three taps. HomeTab does the math.</h2>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step"><b class="num">01</b><h3>Set up your bills once</h3><p>Rent, electric, water, sewer. Each one posts itself when it's due, and HomeTab asks for the new amount when a bill changes.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><b class="num">02</b><h3>Add the everyday stuff</h3><p>Dinner, groceries, a pizza for four. Type the amount, pick who paid, done. Everyone sees it right away.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><b class="num">03</b><h3>Settle up anytime</h3><p>One number, already netted. Send a request, they pay in the app they already use, and the balance resets.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block split" id="features">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">Requests that look good</div>
      <h2>A link instead of a lecture.</h2>
      <p class="lede">Every request is a clean page with the total, the breakdown and a Pay button. It opens on any phone, even if your roommate hasn't downloaded HomeTab yet.</p>
      <div class="feat">
        <div><b>Nudges, not nagging</b><span>Set a limit like $40 or 7 days and HomeTab sends the reminder for you.</span></div>
        <div><b>Paid means paid</b><span>Mark a payment, the other person confirms, and it's off the list for good.</span></div>
        <div><b>Grows with the house</b><span>Two of you or five. Choose who's in on each expense.</span></div>
        <div><b>Monthly statements</b><span>A clean record of every month, with the fewest payments to settle it.</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ticket" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="paper">
        <div style="font-weight:800">Chip is requesting</div>
        <div class="big">$864.60</div>
        <div class="line"><span>Rent — your half</span><span class="money">$900.00</span></div>
        <div class="line"><span>Groceries</span><span class="money">$30.75</span></div>
        <div class="line pos" style="font-weight:700"><span>Dinners you covered</span><span class="money">−$66.15</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="pay">Pay Chip $864.60</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block" id="pricing">
    <div class="pricing">
      <div><div class="eyebrow" style="color:#7FD3A8">Pricing</div><h2 style="margin-top:10px">Free for your whole household.</h2><p>Unlimited expenses, every day. No ads between screens. No caps that show up right when you need them.</p></div>
      <ul><li>Unlimited expenses</li><li>Recurring bills &amp; reminders</li><li>Shareable payment requests</li><li>Up to 5 people per home</li></ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block faq">
    <div class="eyebrow">Questions</div>
    <h2>Good to know</h2>
    <details><summary>Does HomeTab move my money?</summary><p>No. HomeTab tracks who owes what and opens the payment app you already use, with the amount filled in. Your money never passes through us.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Does my roommate need the app?</summary><p>Not to pay you. Requests open as a web page on any phone. The app makes logging and tracking easier for everyone.</p></details>
    <details><summary>What if we don't split everything 50/50?</summary><p>Choose who's in on each expense, or split by percentage or exact amounts. Your usual split is saved for next time.</p></details>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <div class="eyebrow">More from the creators of HomeTab</div>
    <h2>Apps for the people you live, eat and talk with.</h2>
    <div class="family">
      <div><b>Glofly</b><p>Chat, call and hang out with your friends, on your phone, your computer or the web.</p></div>
      <div><b>ForkRoad</b><p>Every dinner is a fork in the road. Spin for a pick or vote with friends on where to eat.</p></div>
      <div><b>petal</b><p>A brighter place for your people. Friends, photos and messages, with your feed in order and no ads.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer><span>HomeTab by Glofly · © 2026 HarborWorks</span><span>HomeTab never holds or moves money.</span></footer>
</div>
